## HC-017 Slice B

Implements the first secure document-intake foundation without OCR, preview, download, real lab observations or production enablement.

### Database

- migration `0049 → 0050`;
- `profile_documents` and `document_processing_jobs`;
- ENABLE + FORCE RLS;
- owner/edit insert, owner/edit/view metadata visibility;
- `analyze` explicitly excluded from raw-document metadata;
