### Intake boundary

- PDF/JPEG/PNG only;
- server-side MIME/extension/magic-byte checks;
- 20 MiB limit;
- 25 MP image limit;
- opaque UUID-based quarantine keys;
- private local development/test adapter with `0700` directories and `0600` objects;
- PDF remains unparsed and unavailable while quarantined;
- no filename, object key, hash or medical value is emitted in ordinary audit/API output.

### Fail-safe configuration

- `DOCUMENT_UPLOAD_ENABLED=false` by default;
- production validation rejects enablement;
- Slice B accepts only the local development/test adapter;
- scanner and production object storage remain separate future slices.

### API/UI

- capabilities endpoint;
- upload, list and detail endpoints;
- new `/app/documents` page and navigation entry;
- UI clearly states that preview and OCR are unavailable;
- no raw document download route.

### Tests

