## Summary

Phase 14 adds normalized weekly-review support and a protected, read-only Reviews page.

The implementation:

- processes validated `WEEKLY_REVIEW` GPT imports through the existing machine-authenticated import boundary;
- stores immutable raw imports and normalized weekly-review records;
- derives canonical cycle-relative week ranges, including the six-day week 13;
- keeps one current normalized review per cycle and week;
- supports deterministic same-week replacement and terminal idempotent retries;
- adds an authenticated `/reviews` page for the signed-in user’s active cycle;
- shows a neutral empty state when no normalized weekly review exists;
- keeps raw payload content and processing metadata out of the browser;
- preserves existing day-status, recovery-credit, task, check-in, and reflection behavior;
- strengthens lock-order, transaction, concurrency, and retry-after-replacement test coverage.

Manual `/reviews` smoke testing was not completed and is accepted as residual release risk. Automated checks passed.

